@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@bookId = {{uploadBook.response.body.$.bookId}}

### API health — expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api
Accept: application/json

### Upload AI document extraction article — expected 201; run before the filtered search
# @name uploadBook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BookUploadBoundary
Accept: application/json

--BookUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Evaluating the quality of AI document data extraction with small and large language models
--BookUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ai-document-extraction.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../public/assets/Evaluating the quality of AI document data extraction with small and large language models.pdf
--BookUploadBoundary--

### Search all books — expected 200 with passages and context
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How is extraction accuracy measured against a source of truth?",
  "topK": 5
}

### Search the uploaded book — expected 200; uses uploadBook's response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What factors affect the speed and cost of document extraction?",
  "topK": 5,
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}"
}

### Empty query — expected 400 SEARCH_REQUEST_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": ""
}

### Excessive result count — expected 400 SEARCH_REQUEST_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How is extraction accuracy measured against a source of truth?",
  "topK": 21
}

### Invalid book UUID — expected 400 SEARCH_REQUEST_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How is extraction accuracy measured against a source of truth?",
  "bookId": "invalid"
}

### Malformed JSON — expected 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":

### Missing upload file — expected 400 PDF_FILE_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MissingFileBoundary

--MissingFileBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Missing file
--MissingFileBoundary--

### Missing upload title — expected 400 PDF_TITLE_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MissingTitleBoundary

--MissingTitleBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

not a PDF
--MissingTitleBoundary--

### Invalid PDF — expected 400 PDF_FILE_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=InvalidPdfBoundary

--InvalidPdfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Invalid PDF
--InvalidPdfBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

not a PDF
--InvalidPdfBoundary--
